### =====================================================
### WorkflowExecution/getById - Casos de prueba (WD-1582)
### Obtiene una ejecución de workflow por id interno o identificadores externos
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Buscar por workflowExecutionId (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowExecutionId": 1
}

### Test 2: Buscar por externalWorkflowId (filtro alterno) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalWorkflowId": "wf-external-12345"
}

### Test 3: Buscar por externalRunId (filtro alterno) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalRunId": "run-external-67890"
}

### Test 4: Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/getById
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowExecutionId": 1
}

### Test 5: Sin ningún identificador → 400 (se requiere al menos uno)
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Test 6: workflowExecutionId inexistente → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowExecutionId": 999999999
}

### Test 7: externalWorkflowId inexistente → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalWorkflowId": "wf-external-no-existe"
}
